    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="In this example we introduce the basic features of pyvale for point sensor simulation. We demonstrate quick sensor array construction with defaults using the pyvale sensor array factory. Finally we run a sensor simulation and display the output.">

