.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Building on what we learned in examples 1.1-1.3 we now have a look at the basic error library for pyvale. The sensor error models in pyvale are grouped into the types of random (`ErrRand`) and systematic (`ErrSys`). In this example we will consider probability distribution based sampled errors, constant offsets and basic systematic errors such as digitisation / saturation.">

.. only:: html

  .. image:: /examples/basics/images/thumb/sphx_glr_ex1_4_basicerrors_therm3d_thumb.png
