.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="In this example we give an overview of field-based systematic errors. Field errors require additional interpolation of the underlying physical field such as uncertainty in a sensors position or sampling time. For this example we will focus on field error sources that perturb sensor locations and sampling times. In later examples we will analyse sensor orientation for vector and tensor fields.">

.. only:: html

  .. image:: /examples/basics/images/thumb/sphx_glr_ex1_5_fielderrs_therm3d_thumb.png
